  "title": "Quick Fish Tacos",
  "description": "Tilapia fillets are pan-fried in a jalapeno-infused oil and served with a quick cabbage slaw. For a milder flavor, remove the seeds from jalapeno peppers before adding to the slaw.",
  "authors": [
    "Hugh Pastoriza"
  ],
